  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Manufacturing sector recovery project in the State of Palestine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Since the beginning of the conflict in October 2023, the State of Palestine has gone through catastrophic circumstances, not only in Gaza strip but also in the West Bank. The Palestinian economy has recorded a sharp decline in terms of local production, employment rates, at all sectors. The conflict has inevitably put on hold all sorts of peace talks and initiatives, including talks under the #Corridor for Peace and Prosperity# # the Japanese government#s initiatives to promote regional cooperation for the prosperity of the region. Against this backdrop, the project will provide much needed and urgent assistance to the Palestinian industry, with particular focus on agro-industry # a sector that is essential for Palestinian economy and employment. It will provide assistance at the three levels; firm level, individual level and institutional level. At the firm and individual level, the project will support the enterprises that have been affected by the ongoing conflict, by improving their quality, productivity, energy and resource efficiency and the overall performance management. At the institutional level, the project will support the newly established Ministry of Industry, which will play a critical role going forward in providing continuous support to the SMEs as well as the industrial parks.</narrative>
  </description>
